  "principles": [
    "Occupations are settlement functions, not decorative character labels.",
    "Every settlement must maintain food, repair, transport, health, care and governance capacity appropriate to its geography.",
    "Citizens under 14 are dependents/students; ages 14-17 may be students or apprentices but not full hazardous workers.",
    "Older citizens may remain economically active with lower physical intensity.",
    "Sex does not hard-code occupations.",
    "Calibration citizens keep their authored occupations."
